  "htmlContent": "<p>因為雲端虛擬機不會包含本機的 <code>.env</code> 檔案，所以必須將金鑰存放在 GitHub 儲存庫的 <strong>Secrets</strong> 裡面供腳本讀取。</p>\n<p><img src=\"/images/notion/4113eb21-f1cc-80d4-97e4-ef3788bdfa16-1.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></p>\n<p>需要以下兩個金鑰，點上圖綠色新增即可。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code><strong>NOTION_API_KEY</strong></code></li>\n<li><code><strong>NOTION_DATABASE_ID</strong></code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/31682f85-b904-4805-902e-18126780c624/3a3210e3-1b45-4e6f-9c69-03f97fe5894c/image.png?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&amp;X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&amp;X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB466WFJM53B3%2F20261126%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&amp;X-Amz-Date=20261126T071008Z&amp;X-Amz-Expires=3600&amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEO3%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJHMEUCIQDhy5ZSqqJdVzcTKUUkzcdwzyX3hvBRSBXNu59INPgylgIgIQvEQKk3l1jWGsCoHuivMUyerXYIbxcN7c%2BAtNdj4TEqiAQItf%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FARAAGgw2Mzc0MjMxODM4MDUiDEjElrgDZ3BSWrQpDCrcA4syU9xGIMbYV%2FeGl36vo3eVX%2BeeQwu9GeKgcpUMvEhLe9zKBdctz%2Bv5s1TeceKkHs2oPSrwSUsQuz%2B94RrYYK%2FyeiHJ1VbS9IjqPOTgFBnPVklT5uN%2F2uOkOmtd1AextTwdpcY4%2Bkr5%2B51%2Fm4vqs9X5xqqSpc4UtE6jN0HgdKoIRnps28YvpIr7joQGeqROCfDSjtf35LlpF%2FB3O%2BqfE1ygdDrnzmAn9DKCW7VeSSDtE5u8tgV5yecx5w5a2aEuvpjHU3rBB%2BeM1PnDBwFy7IGnMIGb8UbEc7J6CjVX0Rv2St6Rhj%2F4Gg%2BhMEsFGyqjtBdiHfPD5ZtxQqMDShvcrgJP5fK4fGSh0hXmLhW0e%2F20xSkOBSqR9XYIbmxd1aDibqBzBc5nVGXqYzBGKD%2BO0Efxy2pESAQTZMnOEqtaYk22Ogylt%2BnAMAGpKctsYCUkgdZ1lIPkvWGACpGKPQTptJ6EM3VYlAWOxIT5wr2aVcG3A4%2FtqSqO%2BmzhvalYBUzt9vbRyhKpLt%2FiyrB33YBiTlnXkKll6zF8YLtxSlzRPxDp4IM%2FeZxV7va9agfKiNL1VVWnAnPbe8re2cg94fqn1gSM2srQHWcFXsWXSwqrcO9G3Qm2oVcM%2BXHfHYU8MP3vntgGOqUBPaMLkFArQGomSX5Il9JsWLghh2SLtis3ZPUlQidpkowY%2FN3h9mLDQEAgABRGga%2BkAOrAa1sbDl9pyLXBYrAsD4Uq%2F6njgYX6jcCvTofqIACpQqZTkeXokYJSrJPVhXipvZn%2FSSGGKmfpK1vT8WPFScLE2CTRWN5nsubdPyfb4t1Xvjj9TKfE6kNpYhzZVGoNIur6EF7UHN1DUrtL95JP8VX%2Bc0Cw&amp;X-Amz-Signature=2b5baaebdaea8a2cab2c4b474707a2585f41641f9030b0cd